{
  "tema": 5306,
  "slug": "veo-ves-presente-ver",
  "titulo": "Ver in the present",
  "subtitulo": "Veo el mar desde mi casa.",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "Ver (to see, to watch) is regular in the present except yo, which keeps the e: veo, ves, ve, vemos, ven. No written accents.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ver** (_to see, to watch_) is almost regular. Only **yo** is special: it keeps the **e** → **veo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The other forms are short, with one **e** and no accent: **ves, ve, vemos, ven**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "ver"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "**veo**"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "ves"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "ve"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "vemos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ustedes",
              "ven"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **ve** and **ven** also mean _go!_ (ir) and _come!_ (venir). Context tells you which."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Veo== el mar desde mi casa.",
              "en": "I can see the ocean from my house."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Ves== esa ola?",
              "en": "Do you see that wave?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi hermano ==ve== el futbol los domingos.",
              "en": "My brother watches soccer on Sundays."
            },
            {
              "es": "En la noche ==vemos== The Expanse.",
              "en": "At night we watch The Expanse."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Qué ==ven== ustedes desde ahí?",
              "en": "What can you all see from there?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Nos ==vemos== mañana en el gimnasio.",
              "en": "See you tomorrow at the gym."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Yo vo la tele."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Yo veo la tele."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Yo keeps the e: **veo**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Nosotros veemos una película."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Nosotros vemos una película."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Only one e."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Ellos vén el partido."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Ellos ven el partido."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "No accent."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
